  "content": "# About Pure Integration\n\n## Who We Are\n\nPure Integration is a technology-agnostic professional services and network engineering firm serving the cable, broadband, and telecommunications industries. Founded in 2004, we've spent over 20 years helping network operators design, build, and optimize their infrastructure.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nWe exist to help network operators move faster, make better technology decisions, and execute more successfully on complex network initiatives.\n\n## What We Do\n\nWe provide specialized engineering services, systems integration, and solutions consulting across the full network lifecycle. Our clients come to us when they need deep technical expertise, scalable capacity, or independent advisory on network decisions.\n\n## Our Team\n\nOur team includes former cable MSO engineers, vendor specialists, network architects, and project managers who have done this work operationally—not just theoretically. That operational experience is what differentiates us.\n\n## Key Facts\n- Founded: 2004\n-